Z||000007||Songman||04-10-2001||09:06 AM||||I actually kinda like the Viper-esqe front end, and the rear is not too bad either. And I would much rather have this thing than that Caprice. Lord knows someone needed to find a use for these things! But I think a better donor car could have been found. You still have those clunky lines in the middle of the car with the side view...<P>Major improvement over the original donor though.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
